":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[3,3,0,3.5],"dtc":[5,4,1,5.83],"ai_spend":[2,2,0,2.33],"tariffs":[14,13,1,16.33],"pricing_power":[3,2,1,3.5],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0411,"r5":0.0755,"r1_spy":0.0246,"r5_spy":0.0814}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrocas","x":"At the same time, we significantly enhanced our direct-to-consumer capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrocas","x":"This was complemented by our revamped direct-to-consumer presence rolling out across the globe in early 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrocas","x":"We launched Salesforce in the US and Canada to power our new DTC platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Barrocas","x":"To serve fragmented customers and a direct relationship with larger retailers, we're upgrading our DTC platforms across major international markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Quigley","x":"We did start to see the increased impact of tariffs on our domestic gross margin in Q4, partially offset by this mix benefit on top of the robust and evolving set of mitigation strategies that we have spoken about previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2025 Q4","e":"sn","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Quigley","x":"With all the tariff prebuilt stock now sold through, our inventory levels exiting the year reflect a healthy position to support our future growth plans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/sharkninja-sn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"We're also excited about how our direct-to-consumer business is developing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"Last fall, we meaningfully improved our capabilities by rolling out new DTC sites in the U.S. and Canada.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"The combination of these elements a healthy and growing retail presence our new DTC platform and further TikTok Shop penetration fortifies our international omnichannel strategy with additional opportunities to come in the back half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"First, we're investing in training and other resources to scale company-wide AI adoption from beginners to super users.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Quigley","x":"Tax presents a sizable headwind for the full quarter of impact in Q1 of 2026 compared to a baseline of minimal tariffs in the prior year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Quigley","x":"It's important to keep in mind that we are now lapping the large tariff prebuild inventory levels from late 2024 and early 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"Brooke, there's nothing at this point, planned from a price increase standpoint in our guide through the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q1","e":"sn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"…just qualitatively, I want to point out that what we've done starting last year with kind of rightsizing the international business and moving it from the countries that we want to be selling direct from distributor to direct I can underscore how much of a big challenge that has been and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/sharkninja-sn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q2","e":"sn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"We've also finished the rollout of our new direct-to-consumer platform across our major international markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sharkninja-sn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q2","e":"sn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"And we're complementing all of it with our meaningfully enhanced DTC and social commerce presence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sharkninja-sn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q2","e":"sn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"Today, we can move even faster, thanks to our expanded retailer relationships globally in combination with the flexibility of our DTC and social commerce capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sharkninja-sn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q2","e":"sn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"Gross margin beat our expectations even as tariffs remained a real headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sharkninja-sn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SN 2026 Q2","e":"sn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Adam Barrocas","x":"We meaningfully raised our guidance today well beyond the benefit we expect from tariff refunds, a reflection of the continued strength we see for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sharkninja-sn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,7647,0,0,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,0,0,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,0,0,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,0,0,0,7722,593]],"cinema":[[64,1,7647,0,0,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,0,0,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,0,0,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,0,0,0,7722,593]],"imax":[[64,1,7647,0,0,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,0,0,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,0,0,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,0,0,0,7722,593]],"streaming":[[64,1,7647,2,2,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,1,1,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,1,1,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,3,3,0,7722,593]],"dtc":[[64,1,7647,4,4,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,7,6,1,7470,631],[66,1,8487,11,9,2,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,5,4,1,7722,593]],"ai_spend":[[64,1,7647,0,0,0,6651,724],[65,1,8275,1,1,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,0,0,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,2,2,0,7722,593]],"tariffs":[[64,1,7647,8,7,1,6651,724],[65,1,8275,10,10,0,7470,631],[66,1,8487,15,15,0,7290,1020],[67,1,8655,14,13,1,7722,593]],"pric